<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mavesa started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mavesa started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings analyst Jose Gonzales started coverage of Venezuelan consumer products company Mavesa SA Monday with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The company &quot;is expected to see strong sales growth in 2H97 and into 1998, taking strategic advantage of Venezuela's economic reforms,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Gonzales set a 12-month price target at $11.59 per American Depositary Receipt (ADR), showing a total expected return of 28 percent.</p>
<p>-- The company's ADRs were unchanged Monday at 9-5/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
